Subject: [PATCH 03/11] Auto-download documents and announce them with a file
 link

Non-image, non-voice, non-video attachments download straight to the
user's download directory (numbered on collision) and show up in the
chat as a clickable link. The transfer prompt used to target the group
JID as a pseudo 1:1 contact, which Adium never displayed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
